sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as ERP_UI_BLoC
  participant Mod as IXModule
  participant Bus as CommandBus
  participant H as CommandHandler
  participant G as ICommandGateway
  participant RPC as Postgres_RPC

  UI->>Mod: executeCommandAsync
  Mod->>Bus: execute
  Bus->>H: handle
  H->>H: aggregate + rules
  H->>G: persist
  G->>RPC: rpc call
  RPC-->>G: ok
  G-->>H: ok
  H-->>UI: result